      ""rationale"": ""Acute brainstem dysfunction with multifocal signs requires consideration of vascular, inflammatory, neoplastic, and infectious etiologies. However, the abrupt onset and imaging confirmation of vertebral occlusion strongly favor ischemic stroke over slower-onset or non-vascular causes.""
