      ""rationale"": ""Given persistent symptoms despite standard-dose PPI therapy, the patient meets criteria for specialty evaluation to consider diagnosis of PPI-refractory GERD, need for objective testing (e.g., upper endoscopy, ambulatory pH monitoring), and possible surgical or endoscopic intervention options.""
    },
