      ""rationale"": ""The patient has classic progression of periumbilical pain localizing to the right lower quadrant, associated with anorexia and nausea. CT shows a dilated appendix >6 mm (14 mm), periappendiceal fat stranding, and a small fluid collection, which are diagnostic of acute appendicitis with early perforation.""
