      ""rationale"": ""Right lower quadrant pain in an older adult can be caused by various pathologies. CT helps narrow the diagnosis, but colonic diseases (neoplasm, diverticulitis) and inflammatory conditions may mimic appendicitis, especially in atypical presentations.""
    },
