      ""rationale"": ""The patient presents with rapidly progressive soft tissue infection following minor trauma, systemic toxicity, crepitus, hemorrhagic bullae, dusky erythema, pain out of proportion to findings, laboratory evidence of severe systemic inflammation and organ dysfunction (elevated WBC, CRP, creatinine, lactate), a high LRINEC score (10), and CT demonstrating gas in fascial planes—hallmark features of necrotizing fasciitis.""
